    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hundred Youkai Master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tactical command RPG featuring over 100 yokai.</strong><br><strong>Form your ultimate Hyakki Yagy\u014d, master deep strategy, and conquer deadly encounters!</strong><br>Challenge yourself in a battle-focused, high-difficulty RPG\u2014no exploration, just pure tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for players seeking high-difficulty and challenging battles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A powerless onmyoji leads a hundred yokai into battle\u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Hyakuyoushi&quot;</i> is a command-based strategy RPG with a deep tactical core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow <strong>Sei</strong>, a young onmyoji who has lost her spiritual power, and the twin nine-tailed foxes <strong>Kuro</strong> and <strong>Shiro</strong>, as they embark on a journey to reclaim her lost arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1752813845\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/9f43d52f53a8fca1c06895d7641a11dc.avif?t=1752813845\" width=224 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl without onmy\u014d arts\u2014Haru.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without pacts nor mystical talent,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she faced the youkai simply as a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind her carefree smile lies a will stronger than any spell.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with a hundred allies at her side,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the false onmy\u014dji tears through the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1752813845\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/90133bf359562cbfcba65cb8a2eb4e07.avif?t=1752813845\" width=224 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D\u014dman, the archenemy who cursed Haru\u2019s master to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A genius of orthodox onmy\u014d arts,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he tramples youkai with elegance and cruelty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To him, battle is beauty\u2014and mockery, his art.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Haru, this &quot;embodiment of curses&quot; stands as the ultimate wall she must break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1752813845\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Game Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose 4 yokai from a pool of 100, each with their own attributes, skills, and combo techniques, to form your ultimate party.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All yokai can grow strong with proper training\u2014build your own unbeatable Hyakki Yagy\u014d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is turn-based and highly strategic.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory hinges on skill order, buffs/debuffs, formation choices, and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no exploration or mini-games, this title focuses entirely on combat, delivering a fast-paced and concentrated tactical experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1752813845\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb100 yokai to recruit and battle with!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000A limitless variety of team compositions and strategies based on skills, elements, and synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/f60d7ded7e9a3c85b245a048071549b6.avif?t=1752813845\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDeep, strategic command-based combat  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Skill sequencing, formation tactics, and buff/debuff timing all matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPermanent growth system  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Monsters gain strength through battle and fusing duplicates (Y\u014dryoku Unleashing).  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Equip powerful gear to your favorite yokai to bring out their full potential!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbTemporary growth mechanics  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Relics and Yokai Seals grant temporary boosts within quests. Use them wisely for speed runs and high-level tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMultiple playstyles supported  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Whether you prefer brute strength through training or efficient runs via tactical buffs\u2014the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1752813845\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Combat System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbTurn-based command battle (no grid movement)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEach yokai has multiple unique skills  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSkills consume cost points\u2014plan your turns and resource usage carefully  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCombining skill order, buffs, and combo attacks changes the tide of battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/5246cc5d49307dc4cac344fef48474c6.avif?t=1752813845\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1752813845\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Game Details</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPlayable yokai: 100    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSave system: Manual and auto-save supported  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbLanguages: Japanese / English / Simplified Chinese  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMode: Single-player only / Full controller support  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDifficulty: No difficulty setting (stages increase in challenge over time)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1752813845\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Recommended For Players Who:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEnjoy character growth and tactical depth  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWant to raise and use their favorite units long-term  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPrefer fast-paced battles without interruptions  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbLike focusing on strategy over exploration  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbLove Japanese folklore, yokai, and onmyoji themes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFor those seeking high difficulty and challenging battles</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hundred Youkai Master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tactical command RPG featuring over 100 yokai.</strong><br><strong>Form your ultimate Hyakki Yagy\u014d, master deep strategy, and conquer deadly encounters!</strong><br>Challenge yourself in a battle-focused, high-difficulty RPG\u2014no exploration, just pure tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for players seeking high-difficulty and challenging battles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A powerless onmyoji leads a hundred yokai into battle\u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Hyakuyoushi&quot;</i> is a command-based strategy RPG with a deep tactical core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow <strong>Sei</strong>, a young onmyoji who has lost her spiritual power, and the twin nine-tailed foxes <strong>Kuro</strong> and <strong>Shiro</strong>, as they embark on a journey to reclaim her lost arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1752813845\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/9f43d52f53a8fca1c06895d7641a11dc.avif?t=1752813845\" width=224 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl without onmy\u014d arts\u2014Haru.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without pacts nor mystical talent,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she faced the youkai simply as a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind her carefree smile lies a will stronger than any spell.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with a hundred allies at her side,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the false onmy\u014dji tears through the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1752813845\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/90133bf359562cbfcba65cb8a2eb4e07.avif?t=1752813845\" width=224 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D\u014dman, the archenemy who cursed Haru\u2019s master to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A genius of orthodox onmy\u014d arts,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he tramples youkai with elegance and cruelty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To him, battle is beauty\u2014and mockery, his art.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Haru, this &quot;embodiment of curses&quot; stands as the ultimate wall she must break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1752813845\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Game Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose 4 yokai from a pool of 100, each with their own attributes, skills, and combo techniques, to form your ultimate party.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All yokai can grow strong with proper training\u2014build your own unbeatable Hyakki Yagy\u014d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is turn-based and highly strategic.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory hinges on skill order, buffs/debuffs, formation choices, and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no exploration or mini-games, this title focuses entirely on combat, delivering a fast-paced and concentrated tactical experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1752813845\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb100 yokai to recruit and battle with!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000A limitless variety of team compositions and strategies based on skills, elements, and synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/f60d7ded7e9a3c85b245a048071549b6.avif?t=1752813845\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDeep, strategic command-based combat  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Skill sequencing, formation tactics, and buff/debuff timing all matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPermanent growth system  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Monsters gain strength through battle and fusing duplicates (Y\u014dryoku Unleashing).  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Equip powerful gear to your favorite yokai to bring out their full potential!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbTemporary growth mechanics  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Relics and Yokai Seals grant temporary boosts within quests. Use them wisely for speed runs and high-level tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMultiple playstyles supported  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Whether you prefer brute strength through training or efficient runs via tactical buffs\u2014the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1752813845\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\